    "t1-summarize-alice": "**Thread with Alice \u2013 Summary**\n\n- **2026\u201109\u201128 09:12** \u2013 Alice asks you to review the quarterly plan before Friday.  \n- **2026\u201109\u201128 09:20** \u2013 You reply that you'll take a look today and ask her to send the draft.  \n- **2026\u201109\u201128 09:31** \u2013 Alice sends the draft as an attachment, noting that the hiring section is still rough.",
